{
  "_readme": [
    "Golden set for ChefVoice retrieval evaluation.",
    "",
    "Judgments reference recipes by TITLE, not id: recipe ids are uuid4 and change on every",
    "reseed, titles do not. evaluate.py resolves titles to ids at run time and fails loudly if a",
    "title no longer exists in the catalog.",
    "",
    "Grades: 2 = the recipe the user clearly meant, 1 = a defensible alternative the user would",
    "accept. nDCG uses these gains; Recall and MRR treat both as relevant.",
    "",
    "Queries with an EMPTY `relevant` map are noise probes: the correct answer is to return",
    "nothing. They are scored separately as noise rejection, never folded into Recall/MRR/nDCG.",
    "",
    "STALENESS WARNING: this set is judged against the 15-recipe seed catalog. Importing recipes",
    "invalidates it — a newly added recipe that should match a query below is not listed here, so",
    "it scores as a false positive and depresses every metric. Re-judge affected queries, or",
    "evaluate against a frozen snapshot, before trusting a comparison across catalog changes."
  ],
